{"id":4865,"date":"2025-07-28T06:18:32","date_gmt":"2025-07-28T06:18:32","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4865"},"modified":"2025-08-11T07:09:53","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T07:09:53","slug":"cach-doi-ten-tiktok-tren-dien-thoai-va-may-tinh","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/cach-doi-ten-tiktok-tren-dien-thoai-va-may-tinh\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean TikTok tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i v\u00e0 m\u00e1y t\u00ednh c\u1ef1c \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"CF0ddMZooogZ85xJe7AlwU7Ggv2\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZQXlds9ZsoNAEgxoh1MljnT8goH\">B\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n m\u1edf TikTok, v\u00e0o H\u1ed3 s\u01a1 c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n, ch\u1ecdn \u201cCh\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda h\u1ed3 s\u01a1\u201d, sau \u0111\u00f3 nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o \u201cT\u00ean\u201d ho\u1eb7c \u201cT\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng\u201d \u0111\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i. Tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh, b\u1ea1n truy c\u1eadp tiktok.com, \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, v\u00e0o \u201cView Profile\u201d \u2192 \u201cEdit Profile\u201d v\u00e0 c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt t\u00ean m\u1edbi t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u1ef1. L\u01b0u \u00fd: TikTok ch\u1ec9 cho \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng m\u1ed7i 30 ng\u00e0y, c\u00f2n t\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb th\u00ec c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 l\u00fac n\u00e0o. Xem ngay c\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><span style=\"color: #ffcc00;\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/span><\/a>!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HUGtdouV3oxy1Tx96DHl7eFLgEt\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Qtb7d12XforS9zxb2felZFNlgMb\"><strong>1. C\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean TikTok tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VQUzdwzCgoknlCxlPbIlXCbOgSb\">C\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean TikTok tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i r\u1ea5t \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n, b\u1ea1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n theo c\u00e1c b\u01b0\u1edbc sau:<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CQyDdvroKo69mkxVm7Ml9gG9gdh\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: M\u1edf \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng TikTok v\u00e0 \u0111\u0103ng nh\u1eadp t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GXqCdnLwfoedh4xzKXrlltbug5g\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WIlPdGw0hoqBrGxiFM3lrJVwg6c\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng <strong>H\u1ed3 s\u01a1<\/strong> (g\u00f3c d\u01b0\u1edbi c\u00f9ng b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i).<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-CxNgdBHxroTbFbx9ZwLlKYITgTh\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;edf0d28b-6f0f-4934-a9a5-318f68a7ff42&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FYC0ZbAHBloJVNFxiXy9lpwyggwc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;YC0ZbAHBloJVNFxiXy9lpwyggwc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:117374,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4866\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4866\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4866 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/14.png\" alt=\"B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o bi\u1ec3u t\u01b0\u1ee3ng H\u1ed3 s\u01a1 (g\u00f3c d\u01b0\u1edbi c\u00f9ng b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i).\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/14.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/14-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/14-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/14-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/14-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4866\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1 v\u00e0 2 \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean TikTok tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EVTMdRaPEogBgWxnL0fluIHTg6b\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lgd6d1i7Poob0cxjOnBlP9zBg7f\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Ch\u1ecdn n\u00fat <strong>\u201cCh\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda h\u1ed3 s\u01a1\u201d<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z2vzdGOpFoiCVSxfVWFlG029gqb\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o \u00f4 <strong>\u201cT\u00ean\u201d<\/strong> ho\u1eb7c <strong>\u201cT\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng\u201d<\/strong> t\u00f9y b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ed5i ph\u1ea7n n\u00e0o.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-RlDXdzRLkovQVVxYcMslOjLFgyc\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;2da3aeda-dadd-4cac-9c9b-bb593d7dd517&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FMvpYboBlEolcOexWW7QlNeCEgXg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;MvpYboBlEolcOexWW7QlNeCEgXg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:121736,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4867\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4867\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4867 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/15.png\" alt=\"B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o \u00f4 \u201cT\u00ean\u201d ho\u1eb7c \u201cT\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng\u201d t\u00f9y b\u1ea1n mu\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ed5i ph\u1ea7n n\u00e0\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/15.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/15-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/15-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/15-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/15-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4867\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3,4,5 \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean TikTok tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KaIadUPB6o39HIxGG8ulasjqgTe\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: Nh\u1eadp t\u00ean m\u1edbi, sau \u0111\u00f3 nh\u1ea5n <strong>\u201cL\u01b0u\u201d<\/strong> (Save) \u0111\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t thay \u0111\u1ed5i.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q5zAdd7bUo3VxexbB0klsTnBgRb\"><strong>L\u01b0u \u00fd:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TSTwdNxdPo2FPexoPdolJKZpgJe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>TikTok ch\u1ec9 cho ph\u00e9p \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng 1 l\u1ea7n m\u1ed7i 30 ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VaJ1dbcuxo2m0sxersHlzlBlgxc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb (kh\u00e1c t\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng) c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S8MidrdEboQcLdx1l7klFEAYgIf\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-DPIJdthB7ojLUpx5VlIlZB8ug2c\"><strong>2. C\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean TikTok tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L5pydLz9goa1iWxKKuXl0VemgBf\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: Truy c\u1eadp v\u00e0o trang web ch\u00ednh th\u1ee9c: https:\/\/www.tiktok.com<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GZuHdecfWoMglpxOk95lwLWtgrf\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: \u0110\u0103ng nh\u1eadp v\u00e0o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n TikTok c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MHqKdwEihogxnBxMwCyltE5fgQc\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n \u1edf g\u00f3c tr\u00ean b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i, ch\u1ecdn <strong>\u201cView profile\u201d<\/strong> (Xem h\u1ed3 s\u01a1)<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-CrG0dUFfwoUGTUxe77bl44BKgTf\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;42007cda-d26e-4607-8b14-20e56de412df&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FWBdnbxqiKoa4W3xU8w7lJ0ktgee%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;WBdnbxqiKoa4W3xU8w7lJ0ktgee&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:352605,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4868\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4868\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-4868 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/16.png\" alt=\"B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: Nh\u1ea5n v\u00e0o \u1ea3nh \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n \u1edf g\u00f3c tr\u00ean b\u00ean ph\u1ea3i, ch\u1ecdn \u201cView profile\u201d (Xem h\u1ed3 s\u01a1)\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/16.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/16-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/16-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/16-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/16-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4868\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1,2,3 \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean TikTok tr\u00ean m\u00e1y t\u00ednh<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C0Y1dEYmVozLP9xbcGzlUwgAg0f\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 4: Ch\u1ecdn n\u00fat <strong>\u201cEdit profile\u201d<\/strong> (Ch\u1ec9nh s\u1eeda h\u1ed3 s\u01a1)<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-W0EwdAvjHot3usxcjHulkg8Wgbe\">T\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y, b\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3:<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PYrmdpKt3owDFvx6w8aluecHgrg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ed5i t\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb<\/strong> (Name): kh\u00f4ng gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n s\u1ed1 l\u1ea7n \u0111\u1ed5i<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RUZ1dbkkyoZlXvxjPopltmtPg9u\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110\u1ed5i t\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng (Username)<\/strong>: ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ed5i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c <strong>1 l\u1ea7n m\u1ed7i 30 ng\u00e0y<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K0jQd2onfomr4hx6WPdlitsNgFh\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 5: Sau khi nh\u1eadp t\u00ean m\u1edbi, nh\u1ea5n <strong>L\u01b0u <\/strong>\u0111\u1ec3 ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-V4kxdsfRco2RfRxyhO2lpJmPghe\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-T59kdtn8eotRCfxqSh3l4WyIgbh\"><strong>4. L\u01b0u \u00fd khi \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean TikTok tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i, m\u00e1y t\u00ednh<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BGTwdPezBo9pgmxAJGAlLf7agtb\">Khi \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean TikTok tr\u00ean \u0111i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i ho\u1eb7c m\u00e1y t\u00ednh, b\u1ea1n c\u1ea7n l\u01b0u \u00fd m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 \u0111i\u1ec3m quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh sai s\u00f3t v\u00e0 duy tr\u00ec t\u00ednh nh\u1ea5t qu\u00e1n cho t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n. Tr\u01b0\u1edbc ti\u00ean, <strong>t\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng (username)<\/strong> ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p thay \u0111\u1ed5i <strong>m\u1ed9t l\u1ea7n trong 30 ng\u00e0y<\/strong>, v\u00ec v\u1eady h\u00e3y c\u00e2n nh\u1eafc k\u1ef9 tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn. T\u00ean ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng ph\u1ea3i <strong>duy nh\u1ea5t<\/strong>, kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ee9a kho\u1ea3ng tr\u1eafng v\u00e0 ch\u1ec9 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng k\u00fd t\u1ef1 ch\u1eef, s\u1ed1, d\u1ea5u ch\u1ea5m ho\u1eb7c g\u1ea1ch d\u01b0\u1edbi. Trong khi \u0111\u00f3, <strong>t\u00ean hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb (name)<\/strong> c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thay \u0111\u1ed5i b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 l\u00fac n\u00e0o v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb gi\u1edbi h\u1ea1n th\u1eddi gian.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C6OtdDvN4osPHIxfulNlvwi1guh\">Ngo\u00e0i ra, \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef s\u1ef1 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p v\u00e0 nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u c\u00e1 nh\u00e2n ho\u1eb7c doanh nghi\u1ec7p, b\u1ea1n n\u00ean s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng <strong>t\u00ean nh\u1ea5t qu\u00e1n tr\u00ean c\u00e1c n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i kh\u00e1c nhau<\/strong>. Vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean qu\u00e1 th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 khi\u1ebfn ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i kh\u00f3 nh\u1eadn ra b\u1ea1n v\u00e0 \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng \u0111\u1ebfn kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng t\u00ecm ki\u1ebfm. N\u1ebfu b\u1ea1n \u0111ang x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ho\u1eb7c b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, h\u00e3y \u01b0u ti\u00ean nh\u1eefng t\u00ean ng\u1eafn, d\u1ec5 nh\u1edb v\u00e0 li\u00ean quan tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp \u0111\u1ebfn l\u0129nh v\u1ef1c b\u1ea1n ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ff7id0OjooGA3YxxCX2l3ys8g2g\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-K7sXdNQuDoUSyaxwacIlFdMWgFd\"><strong>5. M\u1eb9o \u0111\u1ed5i t\u00ean TikTok khi ch\u01b0a \u0111\u1ee7 7 ng\u00e0y, 30 ng\u00e0y<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LGkod8MSMoakVgxvLvBl76Rnged\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 1: V\u00e0o <strong>C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t \u2192 C\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t chung<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QiJId6oFZoiRaQx2SJclV1V8gTc\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 2: Ch\u1ecdn <strong>Ng\u00e0y &amp; gi\u1edd<\/strong><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WiKpdL5RkoK3u3xRcTilNV20gNh\">B\u01b0\u1edbc 3: T\u1eaft <strong>\u201c\u0110\u1eb7t t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng\u201d<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-R7kOd0D7NoNTDxx7B7tl98rCgWh\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;c06b948d-0f03-4809-987c-81342e29b4b2&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:628,&quot;width&quot;:1200,&quot;currHeight&quot;:628,&quot;currWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:628,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCn64bKun9ozlDvxAUqZlhUpNg7b%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;Cn64bKun9ozlDvxAUqZlhUpNg7b&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;im